<title>EGYPT: Egypt extends Argentine wheat tender deadline.</title>
<headline>Egypt extends Argentine wheat tender deadline.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's official commodities buyer said on Thursday he was extending the deadline for seeking 100,000 tonnes of Argentinian wheat to Friday November 15 from Thursday November 14.</p>
<p>Samir Shakankiri, vice-chairman of the General Authority for Supply Commodities, told Reuters all bids must be at his office by 0800 GMT.</p>
<p>The wheat would still be for loading from December 12 to 31, he added.</p>
</text>
